  <diagram name="Page-1" id="QxRxuKffLwehNBWY_ujr">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2038" dy="1130" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Trader\n    participant AuthCLI as CLI / API (live_auth.py)\n    participant Browser as Default Web Browser\n    participant Storage as FileTokenStorage (~/.strategicalpha)\n    participant LiveClient as LiveMCPClient (live_client.py)\n    participant SDK as Official MCP SDK (OAuthClientProvider)\n    participant RH_MCP as Robinhood MCP Server (agent.robinhood.com)\n\n    Note over User,RH_MCP: Phase 1: One-Time Interactive Setup (Login)\n    User-&gt;&gt;AuthCLI: python -m trading.live_auth login\n    AuthCLI-&gt;&gt;AuthCLI: Start local callback listener at 127.0.0.1:33418/callback\n    AuthCLI-&gt;&gt;Browser: Open Robinhood OAuth URL with PKCE challenge\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;RH_MCP: Trader signs in, completes 2FA, and selects Agentic account\n    RH_MCP-&gt;&gt;Browser: Redirect to local callback with authorization code\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;AuthCLI: Transmit authorization code and PKCE verifier\n    AuthCLI-&gt;&gt;RH_MCP: Exchange authorization code for tokens\n    RH_MCP--&gt;&gt;AuthCLI: Return access token, refresh token, and expiration\n    AuthCLI-&gt;&gt;Storage: Encrypt and save robinhood_oauth.json with chmod 0600\n\n    Note over User,RH_MCP: Phase 2: Unattended Automated Live Trading\n    LiveClient-&gt;&gt;SDK: Create MCP HTTP client with OAuthClientProvider\n    SDK-&gt;&gt;Storage: Read stored tokens\n    alt Token valid\n        SDK-&gt;&gt;RH_MCP: POST /mcp/trading with Streamable HTTP and Bearer token\n    else Token expired\n        SDK-&gt;&gt;RH_MCP: POST token refresh endpoint with refresh token\n        RH_MCP--&gt;&gt;SDK: Return new access token and refresh token\n        SDK-&gt;&gt;Storage: Auto-save refreshed tokens\n        SDK-&gt;&gt;RH_MCP: POST /mcp/trading with renewed Bearer token\n    end\n    RH_MCP--&gt;&gt;LiveClient: Return validated portfolio and order JSON response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="3c3Iu6J7p2jDXjdkgPYG-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
